WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,990
Be careful and slow down

2
00:00:02,470 --> 00:00:03,390
Align notch

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,260
Don't fall

4
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:19,780
Senior brother is still rolling under the water

5
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:26,560
Take those losers who are about to die

6
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,800
Throw it down

7
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,700
Senior brother and the others

8
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,930
They are still angry

9
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:34,090
What nonsense?

10
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:36,170
You should reach out with a group of shepherds

11
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:37,830
Do you want a whole boat of people?

12
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:40,210
Leave them trapped here with them

13
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:57,540
You kneel now

14
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:10,960
Don't pick me up
